# Phlex tag-DSL surface — 100% GENERATED from the installed gem's element
# registries (Phlex::HTML::StandardElements/VoidElements +
# Phlex::SVG::StandardElements), because phlex ships no RBS and
# gem_rbs_collection has none. Regenerate after a phlex bump with the runner
# snippet in doc/project/type-checking.md — it REWRITES this whole file; the
# hand-curated Phlex surface lives in sig/phlex_rails.rbs instead.
#
# Every tag shares the same permissive shape on purpose: attributes are a
# free-form kwargs hash, content is a block (splat-args — Phlex yields a
# builder to blocks that ask for one, e.g. `svg do |s|`) — per-attribute
# typing is not the goal, resolving the DSL as known methods is.

